  }
 ],
 "takeaways": [
  "\\(\\eta=W/Q_1=1-Q_2/Q_1=1-T_2/T_1\\).",
  "Lowering \\(T_2\\) helps more than raising \\(T_1\\) by the same amount.",
  "\\(\\eta<1\\) always: some heat must be rejected."
 ]
